  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EUniphar Group is a diversified healthcare services business with operations spanning pharmaceutical distribution, medical technology, and commercial medical services. We partner with pharma and medtech companies to deliver products and services that improve patient outcomes across Europe.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
